  "title": "Coconut-Free Irish Potatoes Candy",
  "description": "This Irish potato candy recipe features coconut-free balls of cream cheese and ground almonds that are coated in ground cinnamon for pure delight.",
  "authors": [
    "TIFFASMITH"
  ],
